  "_note": "Humanoid demo layout. LEFT: 3D + gt/est paths. RIGHT-TOP: software utilisation from /otolith/perf (LIVE). RIGHT-BOTTOM: silicon figures from /otolith/perf_hw (STATIC measured PPA + derived cycle estimate, NOT a live co-simulation -- hw_telemetry.py index 16 is 0 while that remains true). Start scripts/humanoid_demo.sh first.",
